From: Alex Reznichenko <info@botshare.ai>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 21:16:23 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] register: 8 Nov 2026 decision baseline (P-03 rev20.6 item 30)

in_force P-03-rev20.6. Changed: COMPUTE (D-01 Orin NX 8 GB on Robotics
104), IMU-TOPIC-OWNERSHIP (D-10 EKF reads /imu/data_raw, no host
filter), LIFT (D-20 260 x 30 mm tabs, DIN 7984 M8 x 14 into tapped
MEC-019 350 x 140 mm; D-21 backing plate; NPN NO sensors), CHARGING
(D-05 bought later, receiver height wording), WIRING-ROUTING (D-06
checker), SPEED-CEILING (D-07 0.5 m/s, ruling A5), ESTOP-SCOPE
(Category 0), SAFETY-CHAIN-IO (D-09 TPL7407LDR on Adafruit 1207),
BASE-CONTROLLER-IO (CAN3 CTL-017), DRIVETRAIN (D-25 open question).
New: STOP-RELEASE (D-13, D-14, D-34), UI-LINK-LOSS (D-15),
UPPERBODY-CONTROLLER (D-11, A7), MASS-LEDGER (D-26, D-29).
WATCHDOG.md accepted words regenerated; STATE.md in_force; tests.

